here at home electricians and many other trades can make a strong steady living working on Microsoft data centers without leaving town they can take part in high level work while still going home every night to be with their families and that matters you're not just building a career you're building a life here and the impact of Microsoft's presence doesn't just stop at the job site i attend a lot of local events and fundraisers in this community and at many of them you'll see Microsoft or one of the other data center projects stepping up as a sponsor or a donor that kind of involvement shows that Microsoft isn't just here to build infrastructure they're here to invest in the community and

